{"id":"NCT05922878","title":"Study of ALTO-300 in MDD","official":"A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Study of ALTO-300 With an Open-Label Extension in Adults With Major Depressive Disorder","summary":"The purpose of this study is to determine efficacy differences between ALTO-300 and placebo, used adjunctively to an antidepressant, related to patient characteristics.","conditions":["Major Depressive Disorder"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"ALTO-300"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Have a diagnosis of moderate to severe major depressive disorder (MDD)\n* At Visit 1, currently taking a stable dose of 1 or 2 antidepressants (e.g., SSRI, SNRI, bupropion, or gepirone) for at least 6 weeks with no dose modifications in the past 2 weeks by Visit 2\n* Willing to comply with all study assessments and procedures\n* Must not be pregnant or breastfeeding at time of enrollment or throughout study\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Evidence of unstable medical condition\n* Nightly use of sleep medication\n* Diagnosed bipolar disorder, psychotic disorder, or dementia\n* Current moderate or severe substance use disorder\n* Has a history of hypersensitivity or allergic reaction to ALTO-300 or any of its components/excipients\n* Concurrent or recent participation in another clinical trial for mental illness involving an investigational product or device","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"70 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":325,"start":"2023-06-08","pcd":"2026-12","upd":"2026-10-26","sponsor":"Alto Neuroscience","areas":["other"],"central":["Alto Neuroscience · 650-200-0412 · clinical@altoneuroscience.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Site 200","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85012","s":"R","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":""},{"f":"Site 189","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85021","s":"STOP","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":""},{"f":"Site 187","city":"Yuma","pr":"Ariz